<title>PORTUGAL: Trade in BFE shares interrupted.</title>
<headline>Trade in BFE shares interrupted.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trade in shares of Banco de Fomento e Exterior was interrupted temporarily on the Lisbon bourse, the bourse said.</p>
<p>Reasons for the interruption were not immediately known.</p>
<p>-- Lisbon newsroom +351-1-3538254</p>
</text>
